<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 01:58:04 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>Meta 宣布推出新款轻量级虚拟现实眼镜，与 Apple Vision Pro 相媲美</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/23/meta-unveils-lightweight-virtual-reality-glasses-muse-charm-handheld-ai-device/</link><description>马克·扎克伯格在加州门洛帕克举行的公司年度 Connect 活动上展示了 Meta 的新型眼镜，名为 Meta VR Glasses。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2296209323-e1790212160549.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 01:23:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/23/meta-unveils-lightweight-virtual-reality-glasses-muse-charm-handheld-ai-device/</guid></item><item><title>Meta 如何在后智能手机世界的竞争中取得领先地位</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/23/meta-ai-smart-glasses-privacy-wearables-hardware-race-openai-apple-snap/</link><description>尽管隐私问题一直存在，但 Meta 在智能眼镜领域的领先地位、强大的雷朋合作伙伴关系以及时尚第一的战略使 Meta 处于领先地位。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Dev-Meta-Capri-also-use-for-social-thumbnail.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/23/meta-ai-smart-glasses-privacy-wearables-hardware-race-openai-apple-snap/</guid></item><item><title>为什么东盟即将到来的数字经济贸易协定值得您关注</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/23/asean-defa-digital-economy-jon-huntsman/</link><description>美国前驻新加坡大使讲述为何东盟具有里程碑意义的数字经济协议能够创造世界下一个伟大的增长故事。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2286822256-e1790064875511.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/23/asean-defa-digital-economy-jon-huntsman/</guid></item><item><title>雇主的医疗费用将出现 2003 年以来的最大涨幅，甚至连医护人员也难以负担医疗费用</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/23/health-care-workers-insurance-costs/</link><description>随着保费上涨，医疗机构必须决定是吸收增加的费用，向工人收取更多费用，还是削减健康福利。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2218004916-e1790189273747.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 19:43:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/23/health-care-workers-insurance-costs/</guid></item><item><title>经纪公司 Compass 如何向其 83,000 名房地产经纪人推销人工智能的使用</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/23/compass-ai-assistant-real-estate-agents/</link><description>该经纪公司依靠高管和培训员工来赞扬旨在提高房地产交易效率的新人工智能工具。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/CIO-Compass-International-Holdings-Chief-Technology-Officer-Shay-Artzi-and-President-of-Growth-Rory-Golod.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 17:25:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/23/compass-ai-assistant-real-estate-agents/</guid></item><item><title>Z 世代买不起健康食品——许多大学生干脆不吃饭或少吃东西来支付账单</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/23/gen-z-healthy-groceries-unaffordable-bills/</link><description>随着食品价格上涨，尽管大多数人希望吃得更健康，但他们还是减少了购买量，并用零食取代了传统正餐。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2266492757-e1790190038919.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 19:02:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/23/gen-z-healthy-groceries-unaffordable-bills/</guid></item><item><title>百万富翁作家比尔·帕金斯 (Bill Perkins) 表示，父母应该在孩子 20 岁时继承遗产，因为这可以改变他们的生活，而不是在他们去世时</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/23/bill-perkins-die-with-zero-inheritance-kids-age-28-33-wealth-transfer-parents-children-money-financial-advice/</link><description>《零死》的作者表示，等到死亡才将财富传承下去，意味着孩子们往往在钱本可以改变他们的生活很久之后才得到这笔钱。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FDS-PERKINS-e1790188149305.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 19:00:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/23/bill-perkins-die-with-zero-inheritance-kids-age-28-33-wealth-transfer-parents-children-money-financial-advice/</guid></item><item><title>为什么特朗普禁止柴油出口会扰乱美国石油行业并颠覆全球燃料市场——“治疗方法比疾病本身更糟糕”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/23/trump-banning-diesel-exports-upset-oil-sector-upend-global-fuel/</link><description>出口禁令可能会减缓美国炼油速度，并最终推高所有燃料价格，包括汽油、喷气燃料和柴油。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2296111147-e1790184308191.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 18:04:38 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/23/trump-banning-diesel-exports-upset-oil-sector-upend-global-fuel/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普称人工智能监督是“全球主义计划”，阿莫迪和奥特曼前往联合国提出要求</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/23/trump-un-ai-globalist-scheme-altman-amodei-security-council/</link><description>这场冲突发生在特朗普在纽约会见习近平的几天前。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2296043487.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 17:35:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/23/trump-un-ai-globalist-scheme-altman-amodei-security-council/</guid></item><item><title>Zcash 触及 1,600 美元的历史新高，代币的隐私叙事引起了投资者的共鸣</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/23/zcash-record-high-1600-token-privacy-narrative-investors/</link><description>随着新的欧洲交易所交易产品的推出，加密货币飙升。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1234440266-e1790183079416.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 17:06:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/23/zcash-record-high-1600-token-privacy-narrative-investors/</guid></item></channel></rss